  "title_original": "SITE Santa Fe International announces theme and artists for 13th edition",
  "excerpt_original": "The exhibition will be titled There Are Other Worlds, featuring over 40 artists",
  "published_at": "2026-11-13T12:40:06+00:00",
  "article_hash": "d2e5b2b9a5462311415f9e0f942d547d3524296ced68304eee6616b451f6ee1d",
  "source_url": "https://artreview.com/news-site-santa-fe-international-announces-theme-and-artists-for-13th-edition/",
  "article_status": "collected",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://backend.artreview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20240627_SLG_FS_G1_DET_09-2048x1366-1-1230x820.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "Firelei Báez, Sueño de la Madrugada (A Midnight’s Dream), 2024 (installation view). Photo: Above Ground. Courtesy South London Gallery",
      "credit": "ArtReview"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Curated by Ekow Eshun , the 13th edition of SITE Santa Fe International will be titled There Are Other Worlds . The international biennial will take place from 11 June 2027 to 10 January 2028 at SITE Santa Fe and citywide venues across Santa Fe, New Mexico.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Ekow Eshun",
          "url": "https://artreview.com/ekow-eshun-to-curate-13th-site-santa-fe-international/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The edition’s theme, as outlined in a curatorial statement, will hinge on art’s ability to ‘unsettle fixed categories, challenge sedimented binaries, and propose new forms of connection’. The exhibition will be composed of three sections: ‘Worlds Beyond’, partly driven by the legacy of the Transcendental Painting Group, ‘Worlds in Common’, focusing on artists’ perspectives on community and kinship, and ‘Worlds Alive’, exploring ecological interdependence."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The participating artists are:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "John Akomfrah , Hurvin Anderson , Edgar Arceneaux , Firelei Báez , Sanford Biggers , Frank Bowling , Nikesha Breeze, Raven Chacon , Olafur Eliasson , Ellen Gallagher, Cy Gavin, Jeffrey Gibson , Alexandra Daisy Ginsberg, Louise Giovanelli , Nan Goldin , Rafik Greiss, Shilpa Gupta , Sky Hopinka, Klára Hosnedlová , Marguerite Humeau, Tomashi Jackson, Arthur Jafa , Julianknxx, Hayv Kahraman , Lotus L. Kang, Idris Khan , Bharti Kher , Christopher Kulendran Thomas, Cannupa Hanska Luger, Danielle Mckinney, Delcy Morelos, Michael Namingha, Eamon Ore-Giron, Mohammed Sami , Zineb Sedira , Rose B. Simpson, Emilija Škarnulytė , Cauleen Smith , Tavares Strachan , Emma Talbot , Sandra Vásquez de la Horra, Carmen Winant .",
